1
00:00:01,000 --> 00:00:06,000
Welcome to CardioVision 3D: Multimodal AI Cardiac Risk Prediction & Anatomical Twin (Track A).

2
00:00:06,500 --> 00:00:12,000
Cardiovascular disease is the #1 killer worldwide, claiming over 18 million lives every year.

3
00:00:12,500 --> 00:00:19,000
Today's diagnostic reports are trapped in abstract tables (e.g. ST-depression 2.8mm, Chol/HDL 7.8) that patients cannot understand.

4
00:00:19,500 --> 00:00:26,000
And emergency clinicians spend critical triage minutes manually cross-referencing disparate lab values before surgery.

5
00:00:26,500 --> 00:00:33,000
CardioVision 3D solves this by transforming clinical data into a real-time, beating 3D anatomical digital twin.

6
00:00:34,000 --> 00:00:40,000
Our platform ingests multimodal data across 3 clinical tiers based on the Z-Alizadeh Sani benchmark:

7
00:00:40,500 --> 00:00:47,000
Tier 1: Physiological Vitals (Age, Sex, Resting BP, Heart Rate).

8
00:00:47,500 --> 00:00:54,000
Tier 2: Biochemical Lipid Panels (Total Cholesterol, HDL, Fasting Blood Sugar).

9
00:00:54,500 --> 00:01:02,000
Tier 3: Electrophysiological Markers (Resting ECG Waveforms, ST-Segment Depression, and Angina Classification).

10
00:01:03,000 --> 00:01:10,000
In healthy individuals, the predictive model reports low risk (<15%), with all coronary vessels patent in green.

11
00:01:11,000 --> 00:01:18,000
Now, watch what happens when we switch to a High-Risk Acute Coronary Syndrome patient.

12
00:01:18,500 --> 00:01:25,000
The composite CAD risk surges to 86%, and the 10-year ASCVD score rises to 34% (Severe).

13
00:01:25,500 --> 00:01:33,000
Notice the 3D heart physically synchronizing its dual-phase systolic contractions to the patient's resting heart rate (98 BPM).

14
00:01:34,000 --> 00:01:42,000
Unlike black-box algorithms, CardioVision 3D grounds risk into spatial anatomical localization.

15
00:01:42,500 --> 00:01:50,000
Focusing on the Left Anterior Descending (LAD) artery—the 'Widowmaker'—which supplies over 50% of the left ventricle.

16
00:01:50,500 --> 00:01:58,000
Our model detects an 88% critical luminal occlusion, causing the LAD branch to glow in pulsing crimson.

17
00:01:58,500 --> 00:02:06,000
The Right Coronary Artery (RCA) shows 45% moderate calcification in yellow, while the Left Circumflex (LCx) shows 35%.

18
00:02:07,000 --> 00:02:15,000
Clinicians can interactively rotate, zoom, and select individual arterial branches to inspect localized perfusion.

19
00:02:16,000 --> 00:02:24,000
At the bottom, our Explainable AI (SHAP) engine breaks down relative feature contributions to the prediction.

20
00:02:24,500 --> 00:02:32,000
Severe ST-depression (+28%) and an adverse 7.88 Chol/HDL ratio (+22%) are the primary pathological drivers.

21
00:02:33,000 --> 00:02:40,000
The system immediately prioritizes actionable triage directives: urgent catheterization lab activation and high-intensity statin therapy.

22
00:02:40,500 --> 00:02:48,000
Clinicians can export an official printable clinical report with one click, accompanied by clear medical safety disclaimers.

23
00:02:49,000 --> 00:02:56,000
Under the hood: Three.js WebGL graphics with zero hardware barriers, paired with an ensemble classifier achieving an ROC-AUC of 0.92.

24
00:02:57,000 --> 00:03:05,000
Future roadmap: direct DICOM CT reconstruction and WebXR holographic surgical planning for interventional cardiologists.

25
00:03:06,000 --> 00:03:15,000
CardioVision 3D: Transforming silent cardiovascular data into life-saving visual intelligence. Thank you!
